    "detailed_description": "Super RPS is a tactical strategy game in which two players have a series of Rock, Paper, Scissors matches on 5 fields concurrently. Each player has a secondary deck of &quot;Field Cards&quot; that have special abilities that can turn the match in your favor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634770/extras/98eb38b93a0e2754085c91add6d956dc.avif?t=1708668013\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Join the official BlueExabyte Discord and YouTube, linked both in game, as well as in the links to the right!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634770/extras/675145795d341d4efe457423612344df.avif?t=1708668013\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Online Multiplayer (1v1) play against your friends on Steam or against random players online!<br></li><li> Offline VS Bot - sharpen your skills against the bot with the scariest Artificial Intelligence: randomization<br></li><li> Strategize to beat players, select the best combo to outsmart your opponents and win<br></li><li> Customization colors to change the mood of the game<br></li><li> In game chat to talk to your friends while you play</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634770/extras/94e4a92dd9acf7e9b4df0cdcf2a45c72.avif?t=1708668013\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rock++</strong> - Rock beats Paper and Scissors<br></li><li> <strong>Paper++</strong> - Paper beats Rock and Scissors<br></li><li> <strong>Scissors++</strong> - Scissors beats Rock and Paper<br></li><li> <strong>Rock--</strong> - Rock loses to Paper and Scissors<br></li><li> <strong>Paper--</strong> - Paper loses to Rock and Scissors<br></li><li> <strong>Scissors--</strong> - Scissors loses to Rock and Paper<br></li><li> <strong>Reverse</strong> - Cards have reverse win conditions (i.e. Paper beats Scissors)<br></li><li> <strong>Equal Balance</strong> - The match on this field results in an automatic draw<br></li><li> <strong>Ultimate Draw</strong> - If there is a draw in this match, the Player who owns the field wins (CPU results in normal draw), other conditions are normal<br></li><li> <strong>Scapegoat </strong>- Auto draw, but points will randomly be assigned to a match on the field<br></li><li> <strong>Shuffle </strong>- The enemy's RPS card will be switched with another of theirs<br></li><li> <strong>Dud </strong>- No field effect</li></ul>",
